  "description": "JOYSTAR Unicorn Girls' Bike with Doll Seat & Basket\nRide into a world of magic with the JOYSTAR Unicorn Girls' Bike. Adorned with vibrant colors and delightful unicorn decals, this bike is built to provide a safe, stable, and enchanting riding experience for girls aged 2 to 9 years old.\n\nMake every ride magical: The JOYSTAR Unicorn with DIY decals and doll carrier.\n\nPerformance & Safety Engineering\n\"Crafted with a focus on stability and ease of use, the Unicorn series ensures your child's first miles are filled with confidence and joy.\"\nSafety-First Construction\nThe Unicorn bike features a rugged Hi-Ten steel frame and fork, designed to survive the bumps of learning. Safety is enhanced with a dual-braking system: a rear coaster brake for easy stopping by pedaling backwards and a front caliper brake to help young riders learn hand-controlled stopping power.\n\nHeavy-duty training wheels and a fully enclosed chain guard for maximum protection.\n\nKid-Centric Features\n\nReliable Stopping: Combination of front handbrake and rear coaster brake for versatile control.\n\nSmooth Ride: Wide 2.125\" pneumatic tires offer better balance and shock absorption on pavement or gravel.\n\nAdjustable Fit: Tool-free quick-release seat post allows the bike to grow alongside your child.\n\nQuick & Easy Assembly\nSetting up your new JOYSTAR is a breeze. This bike comes 85% pre-assembled. Just follow our simple steps to attach the handlebars, front wheel, pedals, and accessories.\n\nWatch: Quick assembly guide to get her on the road in no time.\n\nSize Chart & Fit Guide\n\nSee It In Action\n\nAdventure awaits: See the Unicorn bike in action!\n\nOur Guarantee\nWe stand by our quality. Every JOYSTAR Unicorn Bike is backed by a Limited Lifetime Warranty on the frame and a 30-day satisfaction guarantee. Ride with peace of mind knowing we've got you covered.",
